{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28765","headline":"爲人题赠二首 二 · 杜牧","name":"爲人题赠二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿树莺莺语，平江燕燕飞。\n枕前闻[鴈去]，楼上送春归。\n半月縆双脸，凝腰素一围。\n西墙苔漠漠，南浦梦依依。\n有恨簪花懒，无聊鬬草稀。\n雕笼长惨淡，兰畹谩芳菲。\n镜歛青蛾黛，灯挑皓腕肌。\n避人匀迸泪，拖袖倚残晖。\n有貌虽桃李，单栖足是非。\n云軿载驭去，寒夜看裁衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28765.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28765","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}